# Raw downloaded asset packs (reference/source material) - only the actual
# files a given feature needs are ever copied into client/public/assets/
# (which IS committed - that's what Vite serves at runtime); nothing under
# src/, index.html, or vite.config.js ever imports these full packs
# directly (verified: grepped every folder name below across client/src,
# client/index.html, and client/vite.config.js - only comment-level
# attribution mentions, never a real file path). Large (700MB+ combined)
# and not meant to ship - if a future feature needs another file out of one
# of these, copy just that file into public/assets/, don't un-ignore the
# whole pack.
client/arms/
client/armview fps template/
client/kenney_platformer-kit/
client/MuzzleFlashVFX/
client/Stylized Nature MegaKit\[Standard\]/
client/Ultimate Gun Pack by Quaternius/
client/Ultimate Modular Men- Feb 2022/
client/Universal Base Characters\[Standard\]/
screenshots/
